(17, 7, 'Profiling Peserta', '<p><iframe src=\"https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLSeAmx9x0dqzEZ71i-B2EJsLcE1uqkhxVvrVHmkHDngF-Eujwg/viewform?embedded=true\" width=\"640\" height=\"958\" frameborder=\"0\" marginwidth=\"0\" marginheight=\"0\">Loading…</iframe></p>', 1, '<p>Para peserta yang terhormat,<br>Selamat datang pada program pelatihan AIA SPEB. Untuk memudahkan penerbitan sertifikat pelatihan, mohon lengkapi formulir data peserta di bawah ini.<br>Atas kerjasamanya kami ucapkan terima kasih.<br><br></p>\n<div><i>Dear participants,</i></div>\n<div><i>Welcome to the Competency Development AIA SPBE. To facilitate the issuance of your training certificate, please kindly complete the participant data form below.</i></div>\n<div><i>Thank you for your cooperation</i></div>', 1, 0, NULL, 5, 'a:2:{s:10:\"printintro\";s:1:\"0\";s:17:\"printlastmodified\";s:1:\"1\";}', 3, 1776828364);
